{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Winner of Best Puzzle Game &amp; Best Storytelling @ Game Connection America 2024)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pieced Together is a cozy scrapbooking game that takes you on a heartfelt journey about friendship, getting older and learning to let go. Sort, customise and puzzle your way through a beautiful scrapbook, and discover an emotional story page by page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/scrapbook.png?t=1742918012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique item sorting and investigation puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cozy scrapbooking gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A heartwarming story of friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Stickers to collect and customise the scrapbook with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/items.png?t=1742918012\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet Connie &amp; Beth...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two lifelong friends who met at 11 years old, and have been always been there for each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/photos.png?t=1742918012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But now they're in their thirties, something has come between them. It's time for Connie to look back through their friendship and decide - is it worth holding on to?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/letter.png?t=1742918012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/